OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy across the far north and
OL,7,Fnorthwest overnight, with some
OL,8,Foutbreaks of rain or showers. Dry
OL,9,Felsewhere with long clear periods, but
OL,10,Fremaining warm if not very warm in
OL,11,Fsome central and southern areas.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FA dry, sunny and very hot
OL,14,Fday across many parts of England and
OL,15,FWales. Cloudier across Scotland and
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland with showers,
OL,17,Fpossibly heavy and thundery come the
OL,18,Fafternoon.
